{
  "id": "MAT.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matt. 11",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus and John the Baptist",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After Jesus had finished instructing his twelve disciples, he went on from there to teach and preach in the towns of Galilee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When John, who was in prison, heard about the deeds of the Messiah, he sent his disciples",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to ask him, \"Are you the one who is to come, or should we expect someone else?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus replied,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Go back and report to John what you hear and see:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The blind receive sight, the lame walk, those who have leprosy",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are cleansed, the deaf hear, the dead are raised, and the good news is proclaimed to the poor.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Blessed is anyone who does not stumble on account of me.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As John's disciples were leaving, Jesus began to speak to the crowd about John:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"What did you go out into the wilderness to see? A reed swayed by the wind?",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "If not, what did you go out to see? A man dressed in fine clothes? No, those who wear fine clothes are in kings' palaces.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Then what did you go out to see? A prophet? Yes, I tell you, and more than a prophet.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "This is the one about whom it is written:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "MAT 11:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\" 'I will send my messenger ahead of you,",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 11:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "who will prepare your way before you.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Truly I tell you, among those born of women there has not risen anyone greater than John the Baptist; yet whoever is least in the kingdom of heaven is greater than he.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "From the days of John the Baptist until now, the kingdom of heaven has been subjected to violence,",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and violent people have been raiding it.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "For all the Prophets and the Law prophesied until John.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "And if you are willing to accept it, he is the Elijah who was to come.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Whoever has ears, let them hear.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"To what can I compare this generation? They are like children sitting in the marketplaces and calling out to others:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\" 'We played the pipe for you,",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 11:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and you did not dance;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "MAT 11:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "we sang a dirge,",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MAT 11:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and you did not mourn.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "For John came neither eating nor drinking, and they say, 'He has a demon.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The Son of Man came eating and drinking, and they say, 'Here is a glutton and a drunkard, a friend of tax collectors and sinners.' But wisdom is proved right by her deeds.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Woe on Unrepentant Towns",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus began to denounce the towns in which most of his miracles had been performed, because they did not repent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Woe to you, Chorazin! Woe to you, Bethsaida! For if the miracles that were performed in you had been performed in Tyre and Sidon, they would have repented long ago in sackcloth and ashes.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "But I tell you, it will be more bearable for Tyre and Sidon on the day of judgment than for you.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "And you, Capernaum, will you be lifted to the heavens? No, you will go down to Hades.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "For if the miracles that were performed in you had been performed in Sodom, it would have remained to this day.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "But I tell you that it will be more bearable for Sodom on the day of judgment than for you.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Father Revealed in the Son",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that time Jesus said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"I praise you, Father, Lord of heaven and earth, because you have hidden these things from the wise and learned, and revealed them to little children.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Yes, Father, for this is what you were pleased to do.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"All things have been committed to me by my Father. No one knows the Son except the Father, and no one knows the Father except the Son and those to whom the Son chooses to reveal him.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Come to me, all you who are weary and burdened, and I will give you rest.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Take my yoke upon you and learn from me, for I am gentle and humble in heart, and you will find rest for your souls.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "For my yoke is easy and my burden is light.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.11.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.11.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
